{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45193","headline":"送大宝上人归楚山 · 皎然","name":"送大宝上人归楚山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"厌上乌桥送别频，湖光烂熳望行人。\n欲将夜舸陪嘉月，肯住空林伴老身。\n独鹤翩翻飞不定，归云萧散会无因。\n从何得道怀惆怅，莫是人间屡见春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}